Z||000007||Old Lar||07-16-2001||03:01 PM||||Various people come with parts for sale.  I know at the Columus show there were several vendors.  Last year, I didn't see as many, but the weather was crap.  FOCOA brings the store with them when they drive the van out.<P>I don't think there was a vendor fee.  Check with Curry or FOCOA.||||reg||1
